"Candidates from 2 and 3 are only accepted when their toolchain prefix "
"carries the public HIP headers (``include/hip/hip_runtime.h``). Partial "
"toolchains without headers exist in the wild (e.g. the preview compiler that "
"some ROCm 7 installs prepend to PATH) and fail on any TileLang kernel; "
"skipping them lets a complete sibling install win. If no candidate "
"validates, the first existing one is returned so the compiler can report its "
"own error."
